  "description": "During high school, Yu Kyung-Ho unexpectedly reunites with Lim Jae-Ha, who was once a complete jerk. Kyung-Ho finds this reunion after eight years nothing but uncomfortable, and to make matters worse, he gets caught by his ex-boyfriend! No matter how much Kyung-Ho tries to avoid Jae-Ha, he keeps hovering around, tormenting him...\n\n *“What else could it be? I came to help you out of pity.”*\n\n(Source: MrBlue, translated)\n\n*Note: Includes one extra chapter.*",
